{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don\u2019t panic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PANIK is a puzzle game where you have to guide different characters to the goal. Sounds easy... but, can you manage it without panicking?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/PANIKV3GIF4.gif?t=1743454477\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The panikers are scared and can\u2019t move!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out how to calm these creatures and guide them to safety. Complete over 100 levels spread across 8 unique worlds and uncover all the challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/PANIKV3GIF6.gif?t=1743454477\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet the panikers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you seen the one wearing a crown? What about the one with the magician\u2019s hat? Or the robot? There\u2019s even a ninja! Each one has unique abilities to help (or not) you solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/PANIKV3GIF10.gif?t=1743454477\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 levels spread across 8 worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">14 panikers with unique abilities. (Or maybe it's 15?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bit of humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of panik!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2749610?t=1743454477","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/39f36ebc3c61126a55e88942ce654ef02d0952a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743454477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/021de392d15a23edcc67ae969885c225f121d899/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743454477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/021de392d15a23edcc67ae969885c225f121d899/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743454477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don\u2019t panic!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PANIK is a puzzle game where you have to guide different characters to the goal. Sounds easy... but, can you manage it without panicking?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/PANIKV3GIF4.gif?t=1743454477\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The panikers are scared and can\u2019t move!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out how to calm these creatures and guide them to safety. Complete over 100 levels spread across 8 unique worlds and uncover all the challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749610/extras/PANIKV3GIF6.gif?t=1743454477\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet the panikers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you seen the one wearing a crown? What about the one with the magician\u2019s hat? Or the robot? There\u2019s even a ninja! Each one has unique abilities to help (or not) you solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img cla